    {
      "id": "operation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Operation / extractor resources\nWhere supported logical gates and PPMs consume time and ancillas.\n\nConstraints:\n- Pauli support\n- conflicts\n- concurrency",
      "x": 800,
